                <pb facs="0346" n="258" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg258"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Swenson reports that the Danish Government is in favor of Department’s
                    proposal and will accept the same as soon as the acceptance of France, England,
                    and Germany is announced.)</p>
            </div>
